Fried seasoned chicken over rice with a soy-gochujang sauce. The seasoning mix
makes more than you need for one batch — keep the excess in a container for
next time.

* Ingredients

** Seasoning

| Amount          | Ingredient    |
|-----------------+---------------|
| large spoonful  | black pepper  |
| large spoonful  | paprika       |
| large spoonful  | garlic powder |
| large spoonful  | corn starch   |
| a fair amount   | salt          |

** Misc

- A coat of vegetable oil
- ~2 lbs chicken
- 3/4–1 cup rice

** Sauce

| Amount                  | Ingredient                                   |
|-------------------------+----------------------------------------------|
| 1 cup                   | soy sauce (can be watered down a little)     |
| ~1/2 cup                | honey                                        |
| med-large spoonful      | gochujang paste                              |

